{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"细小疾病 - 标签","description":"Hugo FixIt 作者，喜欢瞎折腾、造轮子、写东西，分享一些前端开发中的所见、所闻、所思。","home_page_url":"https://lruihao.cn/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://lruihao.cn/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://lruihao.cn/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"浅治法：论细小疾病","date_published":"2026-05-14T16:51:52&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-05-14T16:55:52&#43;08:00","id":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/3-13-qianzhifa/","url":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/3-13-qianzhifa/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["细小疾病"],"summary":"本节为《石室秘录》“浅治法”部分，专论病邪轻浅、未及脏腑的轻症治疗法则。核心思想是：病未深而浅治之，不必张皇用重剂。以轻清平和之方，略加疏解，即可奏功。","content_html":"本节为《石室秘录》“浅治法”部分，专论\u003cstrong\u003e病邪轻浅、未及脏腑\u003c/strong\u003e的轻症治疗法则。核心思想是：\u003cstrong\u003e病未深而浅治之，不必张皇用重剂。以轻清平和之方，略加疏解，即可奏功\u003c/strong\u003e。"}]}